  `flash:/default.cfg (file exists)` -- the gate-7 baseline, unchanged.
- Console /dev/u2 left logged in at a clean `awplus#` privileged exec prompt (read from the
  transcript `/tmp/cksnmpmon/console-u2.log`, not from a tool's stdout). /dev/u3 was never opened.
- Nothing of mine is left running on the box: every `tcpdump` was started by `tools/tb capture`
  with its own `timeout` and all had exited.
- Captures kept in `/tmp/cksnmpmon/`: `s6trap.pcap` (the two control traps). All small. The 1.8 GB
  of someone else's `wireshark_eth4*.pcapng` in `/tmp` was not touched.

